---
description: Prisma migrations are user-owned; agents only edit schema and generate client
alwaysApply: true
---

# Prisma migrations

- **Never** create migration files under `api/prisma/migrations/` (no hand-written SQL, no `prisma migrate dev` / `migrate deploy`).
- **Never** run migrations or `prisma db push` against any database.
- Agents **may** edit `api/prisma/schema.prisma` and run `prisma generate` (client only).
- The **user** creates and applies all migrations.
